# Pairs with GateOwnership. The capture must release its split gate before it calls the root.
MODULE: CaptureKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture split of B moves on to link without releasing B's split gate
PERTURBS: CaptureSiblingDone

--- FIND
    /\ sib' = "none"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT !["B"] = "free"]
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT !["B"] = "link"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ sib' = "none"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT !["B"] = "link"]
--- END
